      "start_ms": 359840,
      "end_ms": 360800,
      "text": "也是一种自由主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 136,
      "start_ms": 360800,
      "end_ms": 364920,
      "text": "但是另外一种自由叫做实际上它是后现代主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 137,
      "start_ms": 364940,
      "end_ms": 368750,
      "text": "这个时候你就是后现代主义者啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 138,
      "start_ms": 368750,
      "end_ms": 371300,
      "text": "你可以无限生成新的表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 139,
      "start_ms": 371300,
      "end_ms": 379020,
      "text": "可以永远生成新表象啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 140,
      "start_ms": 379020,
      "end_ms": 381120,
      "text": "外面一层层永远是新的表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 141,
      "start_ms": 381120,
      "end_ms": 381600,
      "text": "新的表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 142,
      "start_ms": 381600,
      "end_ms": 382290,
      "text": "新的表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 143,
      "start_ms": 382290,
      "end_ms": 385020,
      "text": "所以这三种情况都克服了你的虚无主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 144,
      "start_ms": 385020,
      "end_ms": 387210,
      "text": "但是这三种情况其实都是有病的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 145,
      "start_ms": 387210,
      "end_ms": 390000,
      "text": "他并没有真正意义上克服的虚无主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 146,
      "start_ms": 390240,
      "end_ms": 393570,
      "text": "因为这个虚无还在那边还在那边"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 147,
      "start_ms": 393570,
      "end_ms": 395640,
      "text": "所以我们最后要讲的就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 148,
      "start_ms": 396940,
      "end_ms": 398940,
      "text": "还有一种做减法的方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 149,
      "start_ms": 398940,
      "end_ms": 402039,
      "text": "可以让你彻底突破虚无主义啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 150,
      "start_ms": 402039,
      "end_ms": 403299,
      "text": "这三种方法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 151,
      "start_ms": 403299,
      "end_ms": 405459,
      "text": "当你的注意力又回到这里面"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 152,
      "start_ms": 405459,
      "end_ms": 406479,
      "text": "这个虚无的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 153,
      "start_ms": 406479,
      "end_ms": 407379,
      "text": "这里面这个虚无的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 154,
      "start_ms": 407379,
      "end_ms": 408579,
      "text": "你又重新变成虚无主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 155,
      "start_ms": 408579,
      "end_ms": 409539,
      "text": "你不管外面是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 156,
      "start_ms": 409539,
      "end_ms": 411100,
      "text": "你又重新变成虚无主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 157,
      "start_ms": 411100,
      "end_ms": 415340,
      "text": "唯一的克服虚无主义方法是在这个情况下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 158,
      "start_ms": 415340,
      "end_ms": 416570,
      "text": "里面是等于零"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 159,
      "start_ms": 416570,
      "end_ms": 419450,
      "text": "你要意识到这个零不是什么都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 160,
      "start_ms": 419450,
      "end_ms": 421360,
      "text": "这个零代表着"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 161,
      "start_ms": 424259,
      "end_ms": 427189,
      "text": "空腔代表着一个空腔"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 162,
      "start_ms": 427189,
      "end_ms": 430840,
      "text": "也就是说它代表一个场域"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 163,
      "start_ms": 430840,
      "end_ms": 432010,
      "text": "空白的场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 164,
      "start_ms": 432010,
      "end_ms": 433910,
      "text": "空白的场啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 165,
      "start_ms": 433910,
      "end_ms": 434780,
      "text": "空白的场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 166,
      "start_ms": 434780,
      "end_ms": 436970,
      "text": "但这个空白的场它是没有可能性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 167,
      "start_ms": 436970,
      "end_ms": 437810,
      "text": "因为它是无码"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 168,
      "start_ms": 437810,
      "end_ms": 440750,
      "text": "它是不包含任何实际存在的可能性的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 169,
      "start_ms": 440750,
      "end_ms": 441409,
      "text": "一个厂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 170,
      "start_ms": 441409,
      "end_ms": 443929,
      "text": "这个空白的场它至少有一个规定性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 171,
      "start_ms": 443929,
      "end_ms": 445900,
      "text": "就是它能够维持"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 172,
      "start_ms": 446280,
      "end_ms": 448380,
      "text": "它能够维持住这个表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 173,
      "start_ms": 448380,
      "end_ms": 449010,
      "text": "它是空"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 174,
      "start_ms": 449010,
      "end_ms": 450650,
      "text": "它是往外面顶的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 175,
      "start_ms": 450650,
      "end_ms": 452690,
      "text": "往外顶的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 176,
      "start_ms": 452690,
      "end_ms": 454910,
      "text": "就是一戳破这个表象里面就是虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 177,
      "start_ms": 454910,
      "end_ms": 456770,
      "text": "他一定要往外面顶啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 178,
      "start_ms": 456770,
      "end_ms": 459510,
      "text": "我顶出来使得这个表象足够的薄"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 179,
      "start_ms": 459510,
      "end_ms": 460700,
      "text": "这一层要薄"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 180,
      "start_ms": 460840,
      "end_ms": 462130,
      "text": "他一戳破"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 181,
      "start_ms": 462130,
      "end_ms": 463600,
      "text": "如果他不往外顶"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 182,
      "start_ms": 463600,
      "end_ms": 464890,
      "text": "这个怎么薄嘛"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 183,
      "start_ms": 464890,
      "end_ms": 465940,
      "text": "它就坍缩了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 184,
      "start_ms": 465940,
      "end_ms": 466300,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 185,
      "start_ms": 466300,
      "end_ms": 467700,
      "text": "这个薄不了呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 186,
      "start_ms": 468900,
      "end_ms": 471800,
      "text": "虚无主义者不停的戳破表表象的原因是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 187,
      "start_ms": 471800,
      "end_ms": 474020,
      "text": "因为你内在那个虚无不停的要顶出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 188,
      "start_ms": 474020,
      "end_ms": 474530,
      "text": "对不对"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 189,
      "start_ms": 474530,
      "end_ms": 477960,
      "text": "所以他有一种能力就是敞开的能力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 190,
      "start_ms": 477960,
      "end_ms": 479670,
      "text": "他有一个敞开的能力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 191,
      "start_ms": 479670,
      "end_ms": 482779,
      "text": "敞开顶开来的一个能力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 192,
      "start_ms": 482779,
      "end_ms": 484339,
      "text": "他就不停地涌出来啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 193,
      "start_ms": 484339,
      "end_ms": 486079,
      "text": "这种虚无的感觉让你感到难过"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 194,
      "start_ms": 486079,
      "end_ms": 487159,
      "text": "让你感到窒息"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 195,
      "start_ms": 487159,
      "end_ms": 489379,
      "text": "让你感到世界一切都是没有意义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 196,
      "start_ms": 489379,
      "end_ms": 490939,
      "text": "原因就是他不停的在涌出来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 197,
      "start_ms": 490939,
      "end_ms": 492000,
      "text": "所以他是零"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 198,
      "start_ms": 492240,
      "end_ms": 494220,
      "text": "但是这个时候你要觉得"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 199,
      "start_ms": 494220,
      "end_ms": 495870,
      "text": "这个零是一种积极的存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 200,
      "start_ms": 495870,
      "end_ms": 498600,
      "text": "因为有一个东西比它还要少"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 201,
      "start_ms": 498600,
      "end_ms": 499710,
      "text": "就是负数"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 202,
      "start_ms": 499710,
      "end_ms": 501100,
      "text": "外面这些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 203,
      "start_ms": 501539,
      "end_ms": 505180,
      "text": "外面这些东西他如果也是虚无的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 204,
      "start_ms": 506520,
      "end_ms": 512299,
      "text": "他但是他比虚无还少还少一个什么这个表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 205,
      "start_ms": 512299,
      "end_ms": 514010,
      "text": "外面那一层东西还少一个什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 206,
      "start_ms": 514010,
      "end_ms": 517780,
      "text": "少一个空腔"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 207,
      "start_ms": 518760,
      "end_ms": 521570,
      "text": "少一个这个敞开的能力啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 208,
      "start_ms": 521570,
      "end_ms": 522958,
      "text": "敞开的能力"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 209,
      "start_ms": 524480,
      "end_ms": 527860,
      "text": "就是外面这一层东西是尚未被定义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 210,
      "start_ms": 527860,
      "end_ms": 529640,
      "text": "甚至是尚未被定义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 211,
      "start_ms": 529640,
      "end_ms": 532930,
      "text": "你看我们已经给它定义了好几种方式"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 212,
      "start_ms": 532930,
      "end_ms": 534520,
      "text": "一是它是平等的虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 213,
      "start_ms": 534520,
      "end_ms": 536380,
      "text": "二是它是外面是实体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 214,
      "start_ms": 536380,
      "end_ms": 537970,
      "text": "三是它外面还是表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 215,
      "start_ms": 537970,
      "end_ms": 538930,
      "text": "就是外面那个东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 216,
      "start_ms": 538930,
      "end_ms": 542430,
      "text": "它连他连这个最基本的定义都没有"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 217,
      "start_ms": 542430,
      "end_ms": 547020,
      "text": "所以外面这个东西表象外面的东西比无还要少"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 218,
      "start_ms": 547080,
      "end_ms": 549660,
      "text": "比无还少"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 219,
      "start_ms": 549660,
      "end_ms": 552090,
      "text": "他是负数是负数"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 220,
      "start_ms": 552090,
      "end_ms": 555160,
      "text": "minus比这个零还要少"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 221,
      "start_ms": 555160,
      "end_ms": 558280,
      "text": "比里面你所平时一直以一个庸俗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 222,
      "start_ms": 558280,
      "end_ms": 560620,
      "text": "虚无主义者的视角所把握到的哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 223,
      "start_ms": 560620,
      "end_ms": 562890,
      "text": "这个背后不过就是虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 224,
      "start_ms": 562890,
      "end_ms": 564330,
      "text": "没有任何意义好了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 225,
      "start_ms": 564330,
      "end_ms": 565170,
      "text": "没有任何意义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 226,
      "start_ms": 565170,
      "end_ms": 566250,
      "text": "它至少是个厂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 227,
      "start_ms": 566250,
      "end_ms": 569490,
      "text": "它至少是一个可以有意义的一个厂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 228,
      "start_ms": 569490,
      "end_ms": 571720,
      "text": "有待有意义的一个厂"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 229,
      "start_ms": 571720,
      "end_ms": 574300,
      "text": "让你期待着他或许有什么意义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 230,
      "start_ms": 574340,
      "end_ms": 578030,
      "text": "它背后总会有些什么意义的那一个场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 231,
      "start_ms": 578030,
      "end_ms": 583580,
      "text": "但是你外面表象外面就是表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 232,
      "start_ms": 583580,
      "end_ms": 585620,
      "text": "外面那个东西就是决定着表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 233,
      "start_ms": 585620,
      "end_ms": 587660,
      "text": "这个东西使得表象虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 234,
      "start_ms": 587660,
      "end_ms": 589630,
      "text": "是没办法使表象涌现出来的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 235,
      "start_ms": 589630,
      "end_ms": 591190,
      "text": "恰恰是外面那些东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 236,
      "start_ms": 591190,
      "end_ms": 594860,
      "text": "使得这个表象这一层可以裹上虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 237,
      "start_ms": 594860,
      "end_ms": 597320,
      "text": "你说虚无被这个表象裹在那边好了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 238,
      "start_ms": 597320,
      "end_ms": 599690,
      "text": "是什么东西把表象裹上去的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 239,
      "start_ms": 599690,
      "end_ms": 602680,
      "text": "这个东西就是一个比无还少的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 240,
      "start_ms": 602740,
      "end_ms": 605680,
      "text": "把这个比吴还是这东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 241,
      "start_ms": 605680,
      "end_ms": 607480,
      "text": "把这个虚无啊给裹上了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 242,
      "start_ms": 607480,
      "end_ms": 610120,
      "text": "把无裹上了一层表象"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 243,
      "start_ms": 610120,
      "end_ms": 613040,
      "text": "裹上了表象啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 244,
      "start_ms": 613040,
      "end_ms": 617270,
      "text": "这个比无还少东西就是负数"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 245,
      "start_ms": 617270,
      "end_ms": 618800,
      "text": "他比五还要少"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 246,
      "start_ms": 618800,
      "end_ms": 621820,
      "text": "他他连这个场域性"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 247,
      "start_ms": 621820,
      "end_ms": 623530,
      "text": "连这个空腔都不是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 248,
      "start_ms": 623530,
      "end_ms": 626710,
      "text": "它外面你都感知不到它的存在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 249,
      "start_ms": 626710,
      "end_ms": 628530,
      "text": "你都不会想到他"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 250,
      "start_ms": 628530,
      "end_ms": 630450,
      "text": "那么你就是要去想到它"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 251,
      "start_ms": 630450,
      "end_ms": 632430,
      "text": "你想到它的方式就是通过减法"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 252,
      "start_ms": 632430,
      "end_ms": 634530,
      "text": "通过去领会负数"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 253,
      "start_ms": 634530,
      "end_ms": 638420,
      "text": "通过去知道你的里面的那个虚无是零"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 254,
      "start_ms": 638800,
      "end_ms": 640240,
      "text": "而外面的那个虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 255,
      "start_ms": 640240,
      "end_ms": 642520,
      "text": "外面的那个无比无还要少"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 256,
      "start_ms": 642520,
      "end_ms": 643630,
      "text": "他是个负数"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 257,
      "start_ms": 643630,
      "end_ms": 648640,
      "text": "它在存在论上比吴还要原始"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 258,
      "start_ms": 648640,
      "end_ms": 649840,
      "text": "还要狂野"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 259,
      "start_ms": 649840,
      "end_ms": 651190,
      "text": "还要不确定"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 260,
      "start_ms": 651190,
      "end_ms": 654930,
      "text": "无视一个精巧的被构造出来的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 261,
      "start_ms": 654930,
      "end_ms": 658110,
      "text": "你体验到的那个虚无是一个精致的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 262,
      "start_ms": 658110,
      "end_ms": 660300,
      "text": "往往这种虚无主义者是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 263,
      "start_ms": 661580,
      "end_ms": 663459,
      "text": "家有余粮的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 264,
      "start_ms": 663920,
      "end_ms": 667430,
      "text": "家有余粮的那种小朋友"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 265,
      "start_ms": 667430,
      "end_ms": 669080,
      "text": "他这种虚无实际上就是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 266,
      "start_ms": 669080,
      "end_ms": 671500,
      "text": "何不食肉糜的那个肉糜啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 267,
      "start_ms": 672100,
      "end_ms": 674359,
      "text": "何不食肉糜肉糜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 268,
      "start_ms": 674380,
      "end_ms": 676900,
      "text": "虚无是一个很昂贵的东西"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 269,
      "start_ms": 676900,
      "end_ms": 678280,
      "text": "要维持这个虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 270,
      "start_ms": 678280,
      "end_ms": 679630,
      "text": "要维持这个空炮"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 271,
      "start_ms": 679630,
      "end_ms": 681819,
      "text": "要让你活在这个空炮上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 272,
      "start_ms": 681940,
      "end_ms": 684460,
      "text": "是需要支付成本和代价的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 273,
      "start_ms": 684460,
      "end_ms": 686440,
      "text": "是别人需要支付痛苦的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 274,
      "start_ms": 686440,
      "end_ms": 687220,
      "text": "我告诉你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 275,
      "start_ms": 687220,
      "end_ms": 689890,
      "text": "外面那些东西就是被你压抑的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 276,
      "start_ms": 689890,
      "end_ms": 693319,
      "text": "压抑的真实的痛苦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 277,
      "start_ms": 699920,
      "end_ms": 701219,
      "text": "匮乏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 278,
      "start_ms": 702900,
      "end_ms": 705500,
      "text": "这个五里面的无顶出去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 279,
      "start_ms": 705500,
      "end_ms": 706460,
      "text": "它太多了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 280,
      "start_ms": 706460,
      "end_ms": 708660,
      "text": "这个无是过剩的一个误区"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 281,
      "start_ms": 709060,
      "end_ms": 710980,
      "text": "庸俗的虚无主义的无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 282,
      "start_ms": 710980,
      "end_ms": 713020,
      "text": "它作为零是一个过剩的物"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 283,
      "start_ms": 713020,
      "end_ms": 715120,
      "text": "它还是在体系里面被定义的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 284,
      "start_ms": 715120,
      "end_ms": 716410,
      "text": "所以它是过剩的无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 285,
      "start_ms": 716410,
      "end_ms": 720550,
      "text": "而真正的虚无在外面的那个虚无是一种匮乏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 286,
      "start_ms": 720550,
      "end_ms": 725620,
      "text": "这种匮乏窥窥自我都不写不写了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 287,
      "start_ms": 725620,
      "end_ms": 728400,
      "text": "它是一种匮乏"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 288,
      "start_ms": 731920,
      "end_ms": 734040,
      "text": "所以你要克服庸俗的虚无主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 289,
      "start_ms": 734040,
      "end_ms": 736740,
      "text": "你就是要在表象下面的虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 290,
      "start_ms": 736740,
      "end_ms": 738060,
      "text": "你要回过头去看"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 291,
      "start_ms": 738060,
      "end_ms": 739479,
      "text": "那上面是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 292,
      "start_ms": 740200,
      "end_ms": 741360,
      "text": "上面是什么"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 293,
      "start_ms": 741360,
      "end_ms": 743160,
      "text": "上面那个东西比吴还要少"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 294,
      "start_ms": 743160,
      "end_ms": 744330,
      "text": "比吴还要不确定"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 295,
      "start_ms": 744330,
      "end_ms": 746220,
      "text": "它会让你内心颤抖"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 296,
      "start_ms": 746220,
      "end_ms": 749400,
      "text": "让你震颤"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 297,
      "start_ms": 749400,
      "end_ms": 753090,
      "text": "让你惊讶的感觉到妈的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 298,
      "start_ms": 753090,
      "end_ms": 756580,
      "text": "有一个东西逃脱我的我的把握了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 299,
      "start_ms": 756580,
      "end_ms": 758800,
      "text": "有一个东西超出我的理解的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 300,
      "start_ms": 758800,
      "end_ms": 760860,
      "text": "他连无都不是他妈的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 301,
      "start_ms": 760860,
      "end_ms": 762540,
      "text": "他竟然能够把我逼到这么一种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 302,
      "start_ms": 762540,
      "end_ms": 764640,
      "text": "疯狂的窘境里面去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 303,
      "start_ms": 764640,
      "end_ms": 767040,
      "text": "让我对一切都失去信心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 304,
      "start_ms": 767040,
      "end_ms": 769080,
      "text": "是这个东西在报复你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 305,
      "start_ms": 769080,
      "end_ms": 770700,
      "text": "这个东西在折磨你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 306,
      "start_ms": 770700,
      "end_ms": 774060,
      "text": "这个东西就是他人为你所承受的那种痛苦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 307,
      "start_ms": 774060,
      "end_ms": 779170,
      "text": "是你现在面对着这种肉糜一般的虚无的时候"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 308,
      "start_ms": 779170,
      "end_ms": 781099,
      "text": "所无视的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 309,
      "start_ms": 781240,
      "end_ms": 784300,
      "text": "你把自己假装自己庸俗的虚无主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 310,
      "start_ms": 784300,
      "end_ms": 785740,
      "text": "假装自己是个受害者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 311,
      "start_ms": 785740,
      "end_ms": 787600,
      "text": "这叫受受害者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 312,
      "start_ms": 787600,
      "end_ms": 793380,
      "text": "妄想受害妄想庸俗的虚无主义是一种受害妄想"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 313,
      "start_ms": 793380,
      "end_ms": 796979,
      "text": "以为自己是一个被无所伤害的一个人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 314,
      "start_ms": 797100,
      "end_ms": 799080,
      "text": "然后就幻想有这个虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 315,
      "start_ms": 799080,
      "end_ms": 802740,
      "text": "然后使得自己表象层面的这个享乐合理化"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 316,
      "start_ms": 802740,
      "end_ms": 807020,
      "text": "使你的享乐合法化吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 317,
      "start_ms": 807720,
      "end_ms": 812040,
      "text": "啊正当化是一个享乐正当化啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 318,
      "start_ms": 812860,
      "end_ms": 814260,
      "text": "是一种压抑的结构"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 319,
      "start_ms": 814260,
      "end_ms": 816030,
      "text": "你要回过头去看看"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 320,
      "start_ms": 816030,
      "end_ms": 821250,
      "text": "维持你的享乐的那个那个连无都不算的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 321,
      "start_ms": 821250,
      "end_ms": 824460,
      "text": "那个都没有办法出现在你的意识当中的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 322,
      "start_ms": 824460,
      "end_ms": 826979,
      "text": "那些残酷的真相"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 323,
      "start_ms": 827400,
      "end_ms": 829890,
      "text": "这就是我给这些虚无主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 324,
      "start_ms": 829890,
      "end_ms": 832530,
      "text": "庸俗的虚无主义的一些建建议"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 325,
      "start_ms": 832530,
      "end_ms": 834510,
      "text": "当然你也可以选择另外三种啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 326,
      "start_ms": 834510,
      "end_ms": 836250,
      "text": "就是成为一个后现代主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 327,
      "start_ms": 836250,
      "end_ms": 837780,
      "text": "或者成为一个自由主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 328,
      "start_ms": 837780,
      "end_ms": 839990,
      "text": "或者成为一个唯意志主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 329,
      "start_ms": 839990,
      "end_ms": 842000,
      "text": "这三种都行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 330,
      "start_ms": 842080,
      "end_ms": 843250,
      "text": "你自己去选"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 331,
      "start_ms": 843250,
      "end_ms": 845200,
      "text": "跟我没有关系啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 332,
      "start_ms": 845200,
      "end_ms": 846940,
      "text": "你选什么道路跟我没有关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 333,
      "start_ms": 846940,
      "end_ms": 849940,
      "text": "你选最后这种道路就是成为像我一样的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 334,
      "start_ms": 849940,
      "end_ms": 850900,
      "text": "成为拉康主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 335,
      "start_ms": 850900,
      "end_ms": 853520,
      "text": "成为左翼分子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 336,
      "start_ms": 853520,
      "end_ms": 855800,
      "text": "成为想要去追寻解放的人"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 337,
      "start_ms": 855800,
      "end_ms": 858320,
      "text": "但是那种生活对于对于你们来说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 338,
      "start_ms": 858320,
      "end_ms": 859340,
      "text": "可能是太困难了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 339,
      "start_ms": 859340,
      "end_ms": 861160,
      "text": "所以你们就选这三种吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 340,
      "start_ms": 861460,
      "end_ms": 862690,
      "text": "我不介意的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 341,
      "start_ms": 862690,
      "end_ms": 863860,
      "text": "你当然可以选择三种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 342,
      "start_ms": 863860,
      "end_ms": 866860,
      "text": "就是想象外面是某种实在是本体"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 343,
      "start_ms": 866860,
      "end_ms": 869500,
      "text": "我们就要抵制这种本体的侵入"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 344,
      "start_ms": 869500,
      "end_ms": 872470,
      "text": "我们要维持这个空间自由的空间"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 345,
      "start_ms": 872470,
      "end_ms": 875210,
      "text": "这个你就会变成小布尔乔亚啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 346,
      "start_ms": 875210,
      "end_ms": 877200,
      "text": "小布尔乔亚啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 347,
      "start_ms": 877200,
      "end_ms": 878880,
      "text": "这个呢就是变成后现代主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 348,
      "start_ms": 878880,
      "end_ms": 880200,
      "text": "外面都是表象啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 349,
      "start_ms": 880200,
      "end_ms": 882840,
      "text": "这个呢就是变成唯意志主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 350,
      "start_ms": 882840,
      "end_ms": 883980,
      "text": "两边都是虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 351,
      "start_ms": 883980,
      "end_ms": 885400,
      "text": "他们是平等的虚无"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 352,
      "start_ms": 885560,
      "end_ms": 886580,
      "text": "最重要的是"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 353,
      "start_ms": 886580,
      "end_ms": 890450,
      "text": "我这个这个表象意志的这个层面的这个涌现"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 354,
      "start_ms": 890450,
      "end_ms": 891860,
      "text": "这是最伟大的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 355,
      "start_ms": 891860,
      "end_ms": 895340,
      "text": "伟大的是变成一种自恋的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 356,
      "start_ms": 895340,
      "end_ms": 897260,
      "text": "自恋的唯意志主义者"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 357,
      "start_ms": 897260,
      "end_ms": 898500,
      "text": "唯意志主义"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 358,
      "start_ms": 901720,
      "end_ms": 905430,
      "text": "所有这些幻想结构都支撑了一种哲学立场啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 359,
      "start_ms": 905430,
      "end_ms": 908700,
      "text": "四种幻想结构是统合起来是五种"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 360,
      "start_ms": 908700,
      "end_ms": 911730,
      "text": "五种化验结构支撑了五种哲学立场"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 361,
      "start_ms": 911730,
      "end_ms": 913599,
      "text": "你选哪一个跟我没关系"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 362,
      "start_ms": 914420,
      "end_ms": 916240,
      "text": "你选啥跟我没关系啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 363,
      "start_ms": 916240,
      "end_ms": 920699,
      "text": "因为到时候你会呵你会就是承受不同的痛苦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 364,
      "start_ms": 920699,
      "end_ms": 924180,
      "text": "你会遭到这个符号系统不同的报复"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 365,
      "start_ms": 925480,
      "end_ms": 927300,
      "text": "最终的账是你自己还的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 366,
      "start_ms": 928920,
      "end_ms": 929220,
      "text": "好了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 367,
      "start_ms": 929220,
      "end_ms": 931339,
      "text": "就讲到这里哦"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 368,
      "start_ms": 932260,
      "end_ms": 934590,
      "text": "这个清算系统是实实在在的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 369,
      "start_ms": 934590,
      "end_ms": 935940,
      "text": "因为它在你神经系统"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 370,
      "start_ms": 935940,
      "end_ms": 937660,
      "text": "神经网络里面起作用的好吧"
